# TODO workflows pointer

If the user task mentions any of: validating a TODO file, gap analysis, Win11/Linux parity for a TODO, `todo/` roadmap files, Implementation Order, or OS Comparison tables for a TODO:

1. Apply [.cursor/rules/todo-validate-gap-workflows.mdc](.cursor/rules/todo-validate-gap-workflows.mdc) in full.
2. Open the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/` (`validate-todo-file`, `validate-todo-section`, or `gap-analysis-todo`) and follow it step by step.

If no skill is clearly indicated, ask which workflow (full-file validate, single section, or gap analysis) before proceeding.
